The facts and line anchors are in executionContract.sourceAssumptions.
Style differs by file: ARCHITECTURE wraps at about 118 chars with indented continuation, while TROUBLESHOOTING and CONFIGURATION use long lines. [2] and [5] join lines before matching, so wrapping cannot break them.
